        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Yuda: Beresi gil, ea Hesroni, ea Garmi, ea Huri, sea Shobali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Reaya orjeeda Shobali gwaji Yahati gwajiilu Ahumayi ea Lahadi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Etamu: Yesreeli gil ea Ishma, ea Idbashi, nea gheawunga huda ghaamwat geeguura Haselelponi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea Benueli ea ghweanda Gedori, nea Esa gwaji Husha. Suh orjooga Hurihi, duweacheeda Furati, ak ea siida ang'eat Betlehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Ashuru gwaji Dekowa mideawa gadeem iyeenya, Hela sea Nara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Nara gwaji Ahusamu, ea Heferi, ea Demeni, sea Ha-ahashtari. Suh orjooga Narahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Hela: Sereti, ea Ishari, ea Etnani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gosi ghweanda Anubu, ea Sobeba, ea fuga dooshta Aharheli orjeeda Harumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Yabesi geawal gheang'da ea ghang'al orjooga ghaamwat; ak gaguura ghaamwat gheawungaaschi Yabesi, nea gwayi, “Gweagu gideaba geajiilsi jeeda sawanadeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaguursa Yabesi ASEETA Israeli, nea gwayi, “Inyeeda gigoonyean ghawooda nea ginung' gwaheedu moonghoodeanyu, ak gwanda geatindaang'u badaydeanyu, ak giiheeleewean sawanadeeda ak abeeda ea masawanean!” Ak ghoadaw ASEETA Yabesi gidagasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gheawunga fuga geal suuk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Gelubu was orjeeda geenyea Shuha gwaji Mehiri, ak gwaji Eshtoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Eshtoni gwaji Bet-rafa, ea Baseya, sea Dehina was ghweanda Irnahashi. Suh fuga Rekahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Genasi: Otinieli gil sea Seraya: nea orjooga Otinieli ea suhu: Hatati gil ea Meonotai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Meonotai gwaji Ofra; nea Seraya gwaji Yoabu was siida ang'eat Geharashimu, aba gideaba saawa gearnoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Galebu was orjeeda Yefune: Iru gil, ea Ela, ea Naamu; nea orjeeda Ela: ea Genasi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "orjooga Yehaleleli: ea Sifu gil, ea Sifa, ea Diriya sea Asareli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Esra: Yeteri gil, ea Meredi, ea Eferi, ea Yaloni. Suh orjooga Bitiya was hudeaba Farao, ak ghaghi Meredi; ak gagweayiit ak gwaji Miriyamu, ea Shamayi, ea Ishba, was siida ang'eat mujiineeda Eshtemowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gatmoadaanyi bea eemeeda Yahudi gwaji Yeredi was ghweanda Gedori, ea Heberi was ghweanda Soko, ea Yekutieli was ghweanda Sanoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghaghi Hodiya huda geenyea Nahamu. Nea jeacheenga nyaawa gwaji dooshta Garmi, abiita jeeda mujiineeda Geila, ea dooshta Maaka, abiita jeeda mujiineeda Eshtemowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Shimoni suhu: Amnoni gil, ea Rina, ea Ben-hanani sea Diloni. Orjooga Ishi: Soheti gil, ea Ben-soheti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Shela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Shela was orjeeda Yuda: Eri gil was ghweanda Leka, ea Laada was ghweanda Meresha, sea fuga dooshta sina hang'weaka miyaasiin aba Bet-ashbeya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Yokimu, sea fuga Goseba, ea Yoashi, ea Sarafi, ghayi ambal ng'eanyiida Moabu ak gabiigu Lehemu (ak iidi gaba garayi). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fiisu ea fuga sina dahuundiga abiita Netayimu ea Gedera; saawa goobiita hoowa sea sugoocheanda nea gwasiniisa gadiyeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Simeoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Simeoni: Nemueli gil, ea Yamini, ea Yaribu, ea Sera, ea Shauli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea orjeedaanyi geeguura Shalumu, nea orjeedaanyi ea Mibsamu, nea orjeedaanyi ea Mishmahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Mishma: gwaji Hamueli, nea Hamueli gwaji Sakuri, nea Sakuri gwaji Shimeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Shimeyi gwandeawa orju damwalah ea hawi lah; iidu orjooga ghaamwat ea mandeawana diibiga saang'a, ak eara fuga gheanyaawa ea moahaada muuchi gawuurji fuga Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda goobiita Beer-sheba, ea Molada ea Hasar-shuali ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Bilha, ea Esemu, ea Doladi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Betueli, ea Horma, ea Siklagi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bet-markaboti, ea Hasar-susimu, ea Bet-biri, ea Shaaraimu. Suh mujiinajeega nyaawa ea ghwahita damanda gheambalmeeda Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gharang'weaka nyaawa ea Etamu, ea Ayini, ea Rimoni, ea Dokeni sea Ashani, mujiinajeega ea muut, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea abeeda gharang'weaka nyaawa neaweesa mujiinajeesu ghwahita Baali. Suh hoorgajeega nyaawa, ak ghang'oar jeacheenga nyaawa ak goodiiw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea suh ea fuga nyaawa heesi, Meshobabu, ea Yamleki, ea Yosha orjeeda Amasiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Yoeli, ea Yehu, orjeeda Yoshibiya, orjeeda Seraya, orjeeda Asieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Elioenayi, ea Yakobo, ea Yeshohaya, ea Asaya, ea Adieli, ea Yesimieli sea Benaya ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Sisa orjeeda Shifi, orjeeda Aloni, orjeeda Yedaya, orjeeda Shimri, orjeeda Shemaya ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghwasaang'ayiit muuchi fuga dooshinga ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay ea ghwahita Gedori, mida gayeewda mooheeda, gagasa nyeega nooga nyaawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghwanyas nyeega saang'a miyaas, ak ghabwada gideaba ng'eanyiida ea bwara muuchi, ak ea manda giijuureanda nea gaba seayu; aba gideaba fuga ghayi abiita gaba dooshta Hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu sing'waar gheawunga nyaawaan ghapka ng'eanyiita damanda Hesekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda, ak geabwaanyaada maheemajeega nyaawa sea gea fuga Meunimu ghayi sinyasa hoowa, ak gealas uhuuda ea ghoah ghamneawa, ak goobiida ng'eanyiida nyaawa, aba gideaba hoowa gwanda nyeega jea ghwaak nooga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba jeenyaawa, fih bughalaji muut bea dooshta Simeoni ak gaweay ea ghwahita giijeeda Seyiri, nea shirikarajeega nyaawa hees ea Belatiya gil, ea Neariya, ea Refaya, ea Usieli, was orjeeda Ishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabwar fuga abit bea eemeeda Amaleki ghayi was boosteanga, ak goobiida hoowa, ea ghoah askweareani bea ghamneawean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
